# Brief snapshot tests pin Jinja-rendered bytes verbatim. The Jinja
# env emits LF (Unix) line endings; the assertion is byte-exact.
# Without this, Windows checkouts with `core.autocrlf=true` would
# rewrite the snapshot files to CRLF on `git checkout`, and the test
# would fail with a phantom diff. Force LF on commit AND on checkout.
*.txt text eol=lf
